        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi kpwa kukala nalonda mmanye uzima wangu na vira niendereravyo kuku, ninamuhuma Tikiko, ndugu yehu mmendzwa, ariye ni muaminifu kahi ya kazi ya Bwana Jesu, edze akumanyiseni gosi garigo kuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
